                    <msContents>
                        <!-- describe the intellectual content of an inscription -->
                        <summary>Records the endowment made by various mahajāṉaṅkaḷ for the midnight worship of god Tējinivanēśvarasvāmi of Tiruvīḻimiḻalai. The endowment was made in terms of makamai from the kuṭivāram paddy.</summary>
                        <!-- offers the possibility to give a summary of the inscription's content -->
                    </msContents>
